orpse and run out."] = "Corma Villard waits on the road north of Dun Modr, towards the Thandol Span; Essene a short walk further north-east, and Ebenezer Rustlocke's corpse lies under the span beside her. Rustlocke's parchment goes back to Rhag.\nCorma Villard may not offer Hearts of the Lost yet: if she doesn't, skip it.\nTwo elite Dark Iron Saboteurs stand by the corpse inside the span: pull them one at a time, or loot the corpse and run out." },
