			written = { ["Large Crag Boars (level 6-7) root around the fields west, south and north-west of {area:131} and respawn every 3 minutes. How the rod works: target a living beast, use the {item:15908} and stand still for the whole channel while it hits you. Moving, fighting back, being out of range or anyone else's help breaks it and costs one of the rod's few charges; if they run out, destroy the rod, abandon the quest and take it again from {npc:1231}. The boars use {spell:6268} from 25 yards, so start with the rod, not {spell:75}. Keep each rod: it goes back to {npc:1231}."] = "Large Crag Boars (level 6-7) root around the fields west, south and north-west of Kharanos and respawn every 3 minutes. How the rod works: target a living beast, use the Taming Rod and stand still for the whole channel while it hits you. Moving, fighting back, being out of range or anyone else's help breaks it and costs one of the rod's few charges; if they run out, destroy the rod, abandon the quest and take it again from Grif. The boars use Rushing Charge from 25 yards, so start with the rod, not Auto Shot. Keep each rod: it goes back to Grif.", ["Windsong Crawlers live only by water: the nearest scuttle along the shore south-west of {area:16638}, among the crabs. How the rod works: target a living crawler, use the {item:15908} and stand still for the whole channel while it hits you; moving, fighting back or anyone else's help breaks it and costs one of the rod's few charges. Killing one does not count. Keep each rod: it goes back to {npc:252389}."] = "Windsong Crawlers live only by water: the nearest scuttle along the shore south-west of Valanaar, among the crabs. How the rod works: target a living crawler, use the Taming Rod and stand still for the whole channel while it hits you; moving, fighting back or anyone else's help breaks it and costs one of the rod's few charges. Killing one does not count. Keep each rod: it goes back to Quel'ana." },
