					},
				},
				{
					title = "{npc:524}",
					note = "Rockhide Boars (level 7-8) graze in three herds south and south-east of {area:87}, toward the {area:64}. How the rod works: target a living beast, use the {item:15908} and stand still for the whole channel while it hits you. Moving, fighting back, a heal from someone else or anyone else hitting the beast breaks it and costs one of the rod's few charges; if they run out, destroy the rod, abandon the quest and take it again. The boars use {spell:6268}, so start with the rod, not {spell:75}. Killing a boar does not count. Keep each rod: it goes back to Josephine. A Dwarf or Night Elf who took Josephine's rod instead of their home trainer's is led through {area:87} from here.",
