rail along a cliff ledge, marked by stone totems, climbs to it from the road north of the peak."] = "From Bruegs' ledge you can drop carefully down the mountain into Loch Modan, or walk back through the tunnel. Braldir Ashmantle keeps the shrine on the peak just south of Thelsamar: a hidden trail along a cliff ledge, marked by stone totems, climbs to it from the road north of the peak.", ["Only if the {quest:94473} is gone from your bags: {npc:257808} gives you another."] = "Only if the Fire Sapta is gone from your bags: Braldir gives you another." },
